async function loadLiveEditor(id){try{const x=await api('/events/'+id+'/live');$('#liveEditor').innerHTML=`<div class="grid2"><div><div class="field"><label>Live Status</label><select id="lstatus"><option ${x.live_status==='SCHEDULED'?'selected':''}>SCHEDULED</option><option ${x.live_status==='LIVE'?'selected':''}>LIVE</option><option ${x.live_status==='PAUSED'?'selected':''}>PAUSED</option><option ${x.live_status==='ENDED'?'selected':''}>ENDED</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>Live Title</label><input id="ltitle" value="${esc(x.live_title||x.name)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Live Venue</label><input id="lvenue" value="${esc(x.live_venue||x.venue)}"></div><div class="grid2"><div class="field"><label>Live Date</label><input id="ldate" type="date" value="${esc(x.live_date||x.date)}"></div><div class="field"><label>Round / Session</label><input id="lround" value="${esc(x.current_round||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>Start</label><input id="lstart" type="time" value="${esc(x.live_start_time||x.start_time)}"></div><div class="field"><label>End</label><input id="lend" type="time" value="${esc(x.live_end_time||x.end_time)}"></div></div></div><div><div class="field"><label>Instructions</label><textarea id="linst" rows="6">${esc(x.live_instructions||'')}</textarea></div><div class="field"><label>Emergency / Important Update</label><textarea id="lemerg" rows="6">${esc(x.emergency_message||'')}</textarea></div></div></div><button class="btn primary" onclick="saveLiveEditor(${id})">Save & publish live changes</button><div class="notice" style="margin-top:15px">Registered students receive portal notifications when the event is LIVE or an emergency update is published.</div>`}catch(e){$('#liveEditor').innerHTML=`<div class="danger-box">${esc(e.message)}</div>`}}
